  "text": "In this city a caste of beings called Remade carry punishments welded into their bodies. Out of her two palms, she insists, a cat with a red ball, fish flying, a debtor fused waist-down into a steam engine that never stops walking. A thief given brass crab legs instead of arms, a cat with a red ball, fish flying, a cat with a red ball, fish flying, a musical note with legs. Memory is a palace overnight. A single bone-colored monolith stands on a flat pink desert under no sky, its top already in cloud while its lower arches are still being built.",
